That evening, Murad fixed a small bell to the garden gate. ''Now I will always hear it,'' he said. His father smiled and told him that everyone makes mistakes, but the important thing is to learn from them.', NULL, '{"A": "He was angry with his sister.", "B": "He felt guilty and upset.", "C": "He felt relieved.", "D": "He did not care.", "E": "He was excited."}'::jsonb, 'B', NULL, 'Cavab mətnə əsaslanır: «He felt guilty and upset.».');

