Not every reviewer agreed. One complained that the variety ''flattened'' a word the author had chosen deliberately to repeat. Kamala accepted the criticism calmly. Every translation, she said, involves losses; the question is only which losses you choose.', NULL, '{"A": "It suggested the characters were related.", "B": "English readers would not understand it.", "C": "It sounded cold and slightly insulting in English.", "D": "It was too sweet.", "E": "It was too long."}'::jsonb, 'C', NULL, 'Cavab mətnə əsaslanır: «It sounded cold and slightly insulting in English.».');

